# What is Golem
Golem is a tableau-based automated theorem prover for graded modal logic.

# How to run Golem
The easiest way to run Golem is to pull the docker image using

`docker pull dionrecai/golem:latest`,

then run the container using:

`docker run -d -p 3001:3000 dionrecai/golem:latest`.

You can change port `3001` to any available port.

Finally, Golem's web app will be available at
`localhost:3001` or whatever port you set.
